# Site Deployment Configuration for Shaw-Spell
#
# Copy this file to .site-config and fill in your deployment's font origin.
# .site-config is gitignored and will not be committed.
#
# If .site-config doesn't exist, `make install-site` requires FONT_URL on the
# command line instead. Only install-site reads it; every other target serves
# its own fonts from /fonts.

# Where the DEPLOYED pages fetch Bernie Sans and Inter Alia from. Must be
# absolute — an origin, or a path rooted at the deployed docroot — and must
# send CORS headers for cross-origin fetches.
FONT_URL = https://joro.io/wp-content/uploads/fonts
